Art Style
Clean futuristic European BD / comic-book portrait style, optimized for phone viewing.
Use crisp black ink outlines, simplified anatomy, and flat comic shading with only a few shadow layers. The face should look like a clean drawn character, not realistic painting: smooth skin, minimal texture, clear jaw/nose/eye shapes, elegant expression, and readable features even at small size.
Colors should be deep sci-fi gradients rather than heavy rendering: midnight blue, electric cyan, icy white, subtle violet, and clean Photoshop-like gradient lighting. Use high contrast between dark clothing/background and glowing neon accents. Special effects should be clean and graphic: thin luminous lines, soft controlled glows, bright rim light, and polished blue-white highlights.
Character design for rich humain: refined, aristocratic, mysterious, ultra-advanced human. White/silver hair, calm distant gaze, elegant high-collar nanotech robe or uniform, glowing class marker/sigil on the face or clothing. No bulky tech, no visible biotech, no jewelry overload. Technology should feel almost magical, but still believable sci-fi.
Keywords:
European BD sci-fi, clean comic lines, simplified cel shading, phone-friendly portrait, deep blue cyan gradients, elegant futuristic aristocrat, glowing nanotech robe, mysterious calm expression, clean special FX, high contrast, polished comic-book sci-fi.

